ext-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 光谕•肃清万恶.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/f1h5dn57si3af6l4jmnxicnsh0z3e79.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%89%E8%B0%95%E2%80%A2%E8%82%83%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%87%E6%81%B6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/f1h5dn57si3af6l4jmnxicnsh0z3e79.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%89%E8%B0%95%E2%80%A2%E8%82%83%E6%B8%85%E4%B8%87%E6%81%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b3/f1h5dn57si3af6l4jmnxicnsh0z3e79.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />光谕•肃清万恶\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>3-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）准备<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合，对目标范围<font color=\"red\">2</font>格内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"purple\">130%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"火属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">火属性</font></span></span>]伤害，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合，攻击[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"大型角色\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">大型角色</font></span></span>]时，伤害额外提高<font color=\"purple\">100%</font>。继续对目标范围<font color=\"red\">5</font>格内所有敌人攻击，造成<font color=\"purple\">80%</font>伤害，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼受治疗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。技能释放后，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳过回合\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳过回合</font></span></span>]。没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光谕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">光谕</font></span></span>]时，技能变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"blue\">肃清万恶</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 3-4 2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/ag3gs346w3on5jo0xting005w083n4o.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_3-4_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6a/ag3gs346w3on5jo0xting005w083n4o.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\